# At most eight analyses are held: a ninth drops the one used least
# recently, and the diagnostics it gave. A request uses an analysis, so
# p1.tally keeps its own and p2.tally loses its; saving p2.tally makes it
# again, and drops the next least recently used, p3.tally's.
initialize
open p1.tally
| nothing + 1
open p2.tally
| nothing + 1
open p3.tally
| nothing + 1
open p4.tally
| nothing + 1
open p5.tally
| nothing + 1
open p6.tally
| nothing + 1
open p7.tally
| nothing + 1
open p8.tally
| nothing + 1
hover p1.tally 1:1
open p9.tally
| nothing + 1
save p2.tally
